UID:stanford_campus-localist-53817269476827-53817351718049@local-events
DESCRIPTION:While the wealth gap in the United States continues to widen\,
  America's social safety net is under strain — steep Medicaid cuts\, Soc
 ial Security projected to run dry within a decade\, and programs increasin
 gly hard to access for the people who need them most. This panel brings to
 gether GSB innovators building companies that provide access to these esse
 ntial services\, and an investor who has spent his career supporting ventu
 res dedicated to advancing health\, wealth and work in the United States.
 \n\nAges: All ages\nLast synced: 2026-10-28 11:42 PDT
END:VEVENT
